VISIBLE_PAGE Every client request carries the io.modelcontextprotocol/protocolVersion and io.modelcontextprotocol/clientCapabilities fields in _meta, and normally io.modelcontextprotocol/clientInfo as well, so the server can identify the client without relying on connection state.
